    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 91,
        "endOffset": 219,
        "text": "he dentist comes into the room, they place a lead apron over the top of you whilst they quickly jump out, and you get your X-ray",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "VlZT9q3xeQ",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 136,
        "text": "Well, this is a similar type shield that might be used if you're undergoing radiotherapy breast cancer treatment, but it isn't failsafe.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "Ml0Uofdh99",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 153,
        "text": "The lead that they use is toxic, it costs a lot of money, and it costs a lot of time for the centers, which is why they tend to opt out of this decision.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "GslNz-1adO",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 266,
        "text": "However, this means that the women who are undergoing this treatment will receive harmful unwanted radiation to their contralateral breast, which is just a fancy word for the breast that's not being treated, and this is an unwanted byproduct of being free of cancer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5UEKp8wV4H",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 170,
        "endOffset": 181,
        "text": " scale mail",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "oKLwifAyKZ",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "Could this ancient shielding technique be more effective than what we're using today",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "aClB9OR0ez",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "Now, some early forms of scale mail were documented by the Chinese, who used them to protect their horses during battle.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "-BEmrh9a5W",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 240,
        "text": "The Japanese samurai used to beat individual leaves, replicating that of fish scales, [which] was also found in Roman and Persian armies and is also found on this very cute animal called the pangolin, which is very effective for protection.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "hsg2rfrcvg",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "So this is my device called the SMART armor, which stands for \"Scale Mail Armor for Radiation Therapy.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "uQfmW8klF3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 119,
        "endOffset": 151,
        "text": " for what felt like an eternity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "PSH61AMYcz",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 87,
        "text": "So, to test my device, I used what we would consider a typical breast cancer treatment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F5yVKWUksB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 139,
        "text": "And this was found that I could reduce doses to the contralateral breast by up to 80%, reducing the radiation levels to this breast by 80%.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "OMclqT0mO8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 44,
        "endOffset": 73,
        "text": " you may have already noticed",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "jLK8RhYZ32",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 137,
        "text": "Now, what makes this device different, which you may have already noticed, is not only the use of scale mail, but also the use of copper.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "olZEer0_zi",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 150,
        "text": "Now, I found that copper was 20% more effective at the skin level than lead, something that contradicts global standards that we should be using lead.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0PhYpftCuV",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 130,
        "text": "Now, I've performed all of my testing at the Chris O'Brien Lifehouse, and I'm overwhelmed and absolutely ecstatic at the response.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ljy46xF8iP",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 117,
        "text": "It has approval from the Therapeutic Goods Administration of Australia, which means that it's ready for clinical use.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "HHlBh9s1n1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 35,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "so don't go thinking you can steal it",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "NL_pIb-GgN",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "And my paper is soon to be published in the Journal of Applied Medical Physics, which is based in North America.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0inHxQzifb",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 130,
        "endOffset": 224,
        "text": " this just shows how an ancient technology can be refocused for future scientific breakthrough",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4w5dUeRTjr",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "ancient shielding technique",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E5rJ0etor2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 116,
        "text": "The ancient curving, conforming nature of this material made it ideal for its new purpose, potentially saving lives.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "vQLdITRcq7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 255,
        "text": "Now, I'd like to change your focus a bit to a problem where I've also focused my thinking: solar panels, which are expensive to buy, difficult to install, and thus become almost impractical when helping to solve the developing world's great energy crisis.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "bKu6x0deCU",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 139,
        "text": "Many millions of dollars and thousands of researchers across the world are looking to improve solar panel efficiency by one or two percent.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "G0zaboB4Ju",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 103,
        "endOffset": 121,
        "text": "ancient technology",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "xYaeED3HjU",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "Now, on a different note for a second, 71% of our world is covered in water; 96.5% of this is found in the oceans.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "KZ6Ig9Jqdd",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 165,
        "text": "Now, of all of this water that covers our planet, only one percent is able to be drunk, and only one percent holds the basic properties needed to make it consumable.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E6qL95HfOW",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 5,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "I want you guys to remember this",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "L7tCnj7i71",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "But for centuries, humans have used water to scientifically aid our existence.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "yFE3qrQ1k6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 194,
        "text": "In 1500 BC, the ancient Egyptians created the first clock, which was a water clock where they used a water-dripping vessel which was calibrated against the movements of the Sun to tell the time.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "WlgJJMKnaX",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 130,
        "text": "Now, interestingly enough, it was the most accurate time measurement until the 17th century, when the pendulum clock was invented.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "hJ-0qG_5CU",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "Water has also been used to further exemplify beauty and magnify what we know as beautiful and as nature.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "VTZufpYklP",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 136,
        "text": "So my idea was to apply this ancient water-dropping technique to solar panels in order to make a solar panel mechanically track the Sun.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "G65dtg_XuI",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
